# Nexa Paraguay — Research repo
# This is a documentation-only repository. There are no runtime env vars
# to set here. Real secrets (Supabase, GA4, HubSpot, Mailchimp, etc.)
# live in the platform app at:
#   Ai-Whisperers/paragu-ai-platform → apps/nexa-paraguay/.env.example
# and in the platform's GitHub Actions + Docker Swarm secrets.

# The only "env" in this repo is the local working copy, which is empty
# by design. If you're a new contributor and `node` complains, that's
# a sign you're editing the wrong repository.
